{"v":4,"catch":"在 Funko Fusion 體驗前所未有的粉絲盛宴！","desc":"在一款動作冒險遊戲中，體驗受您最喜愛的一些系列啟發的標誌性世界和混搭角色，並享受來自 10:10 Games 創意頭腦的獨特真實、不敬的幽默。\n\n來自 20 多部人氣系列作品、超過 60 名獨特的可玩角色化身 Funko Pop! 可愛公仔，讓身為粉絲的你玩出屬於自己的風格。探索以《Jurassic World》、《Back to the Future》、《JAWS》、《The Thing》、《Chucky》、《Battlestar Galactica》、《Hot Fuzz》、《The Umbrella Academy》、《Five Nights at Freddy’s》、《Masters of the Universe》和《Invincible》等眾多名作為靈感打造的美麗世界！\n\n探索經典世界\n縱身躍入多采多姿、充滿個性的廣闊世界，對抗敵人並破解謎題。重溫最愛電影、電視劇、漫畫及其他作品的難忘時刻。忠實呈現、全新體驗，品味同為粉絲的製作團隊寫給所有粉絲的情書。\n\n迷文化大亂鬥\n化身你最愛的角色，獲得角色專屬的武器及技能。\n\nFunko 加持\n獨一無二的流行文化盛宴，為你打造活靈活現的 Funko 世界。","publisher":"10:10 Games","release":"2026-04-30","genres":["冒險","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)","泰文","波蘭文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 12.9GB / Switch 12.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b05a06e86f2c61e142a291bbd06b077ea2378772d9133cd25c07d5bec704eb1e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d77cf040ee5bb3474c22ee6d2ef9907097b2a2d1a53eed92718ad897343f9713.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f5aad839b540a3d893a6950e2ab20762229bd5a81e1ac81a5c0d2dd8f954525.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d7670dc2d559d955552c5b5297fd0378f27f86da3da7d3932381acf040fa97f4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/92cc030a0b40899be7f2e7ead4e1422230a47b2c73fb51e62506de2a8e8b62fc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80fcd9434f44229ada8129f6cbc8d36d252090e8a6d520bcee8e08cadf238971.jpg"],"titleId":"010058f01df8c000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000050216","name":"Funko Fusion - The Walking Dead Pack","img":"d866c1e1b5b56adacaec3a2d741921af256e110e7d7fd60212939363670b23ea","date":"2026-04-30","mem":false},{"id":"70050000053586","name":"Funko Fusion - The Bob Ross Pack","img":"009efb4bb872ab638dcac70202b0e0fe814c68bff64502dcefb0fa5b9b9b416d","date":"2026-04-30","mem":false},{"id":"70050000053593","name":"Funko Fusion - Invincible Pack","img":"375064e0919e3b4b19f